  "validation_rules": [
    "Regular Capital Market equities sessions use 09:15–15:30 Asia/Kolkata on Monday–Friday unless declared a full-day trading holiday.",
    "Weekends are closed by default. A weekend date is considered an eligible normal session only when an explicit special_sessions entry says regular_hours_compatible=true.",
    "Declared full-day holiday dates remain closed except when an explicit special-session record exists.",
    "The special sessions listed with regular_hours_compatible=false are excluded from both regular-grid intraday and positional labels; do not infer their close from a standard session schedule.",
    "The 2025-02-01 normal-budget session is permitted for both horizons and must carry an ex-ante budget-event indicator.",
    "Any SPOT observations outside listed regular or explicit special session rules fail the developer data preflight and must be reconciled against a source circular before label generation.",
    "Calendar source bytes and generated session calendar bytes must both be pinned in the R3 label manifest and preregistration before label generation.",
    "Any declared normal weekday session with missing SPOT bars or a date absent from this calendar is a data-quality event; do not silently move fold or sample dates."
  ],
